    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41228" root="هض" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَضَاضَةٌ</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحَابَةٌ</span>, (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُضَاضَةٌ</span>, (so in the
JK,) (assumed tropical:)  <i>What is taken</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا يُهْتَضُّ</span> [in the CK,
erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَهْتَضُّ</span>,]) <i>from any one.</i> (JK [where
it immediately follows the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِهْتَضَضْتُ مِنْ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٍ شَيْئًا</span> explained as above], Sgh, K.)

